From: panvk-kbase-android worker <panvk-worker@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH csf-v11 175] panvk: descriptor-buffer debug toggles, structured texel buffers
Generated-by: LLM

DEBUG BUILD ONLY (branch debug/rdr1-descbuf). A D3D12 title loses the
device (CS translation fault on the vertex/tiler queue) since csf-v11/125
started binding descriptor-buffer embedded samplers and implemented
vkCmdSetDescriptorBufferOffsets2EXT. PANVK_NO_EMBEDDED_SAMPLERS=1 and
PANVK_NO_DESC_OFFSETS2=1 restore the old no-ops one at a time.

Also write texel-buffer descriptors from vkGetDescriptorEXT as the same
structured buffer (stride + format conversion) a VkBufferView gets; it
wrote a plain buffer without format. biblioklept

Tested GPU: Mali-G615 MC2 (OPPO CPH2763, MT6878)
Tested Kbase UAPI: 1.21
Dependencies: csf-v11/174

diff --git a/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c b/src/panfrost/vulkan/csf/panvk_vX_cmd_draw.c
